## Key Findings

- **Blending WAS the bottleneck** (49.7ms/frame = 80.5%), now fixed via mask caching
- **Persistent caching** eliminates both mask precompute (25.7s→5ms) and coord detection (19.8s→0ms via --use_saved_coord) on repeat sessions
- **DWPose/S3FD resist batching**: mmpose API overhead (DWPose), memory bandwidth at full res (S3FD)
- Pipeline is fully deterministic (1500/1500 bit-identical)

